{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the <strong>Magic Well</strong> to enter the world of books. Traverse <strong>procedurally generated arcane dungeons</strong>, fight <strong>unique ink monsters</strong> and become a powerful wizard who gathered all the wisdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/d6640cb0abbc7c2c3401ae2ad2d6e99c.poster.avif?t=1766051390\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/d6640cb0abbc7c2c3401ae2ad2d6e99c.webm?t=1766051390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/d6640cb0abbc7c2c3401ae2ad2d6e99c.mp4?t=1766051390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/0e60259ba523b14a524b9aa0989117e4.avif?t=1766051390\" width=616 height=309 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine magical scrolls and spells found in the books to craft a customizable magic gun as you descend deeper into the well. Create a single, devastating projectile unleashing immense destruction in a single strike or trigger a chain of projectiles one after another. Experiment with builds to reach mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/d533358abc3072a6917fff5afe19de06.avif?t=1766051390\" width=616 height=309 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each run, <strong>unlock new items</strong>, <strong>spells</strong> and <strong>dungeon rooms</strong> that permanently expand future playthroughs. Level up your wizard and adapt your builds to face new challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play. Improve. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a unique experience. Unlock new scrolls, discover powerful spell combinations and synergies and create builds that best suit your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a <strong>custom magic gun</strong> using <strong>powerful spell combinations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong> ensure no two runs are the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight <strong>ink monsters</strong> and <strong>challenging bosses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock dozens of scrolls and magical items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy-to-learn combat system</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Starrow Castles Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! We're Adrian and Krzysztof, two friends creating this game. We've put a lot of love and determination into making our dream come true with our very first title - <i>Wish Me Well</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please keep in mind that we're very small studio at the beginning of game-creating journey and while we've done our best to give you the best possible experience it may have its flaws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for giving us and our game a try and have fun playing it!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2140310?t=1766051390","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/aa84a0eb2c36bfd7e7d3382b40da5dfb164f82b1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766051390","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/52a1ddaf7ea6a6686ae6857186181646fa2838e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766051390","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/52a1ddaf7ea6a6686ae6857186181646fa2838e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766051390","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3716400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the <strong>Magic Well</strong> to enter the world of books. Traverse <strong>procedurally generated arcane dungeons</strong>, fight <strong>unique ink monsters</strong> and become a powerful wizard who gathered all the wisdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/d6640cb0abbc7c2c3401ae2ad2d6e99c.poster.avif?t=1766051390\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/d6640cb0abbc7c2c3401ae2ad2d6e99c.webm?t=1766051390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/d6640cb0abbc7c2c3401ae2ad2d6e99c.mp4?t=1766051390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/0e60259ba523b14a524b9aa0989117e4.avif?t=1766051390\" width=616 height=309 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine magical scrolls and spells found in the books to craft a customizable magic gun as you descend deeper into the well. Create a single, devastating projectile unleashing immense destruction in a single strike or trigger a chain of projectiles one after another. Experiment with builds to reach mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/d533358abc3072a6917fff5afe19de06.avif?t=1766051390\" width=616 height=309 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each run, <strong>unlock new items</strong>, <strong>spells</strong> and <strong>dungeon rooms</strong> that permanently expand future playthroughs. Level up your wizard and adapt your builds to face new challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play. Improve. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a unique experience. Unlock new scrolls, discover powerful spell combinations and synergies and create builds that best suit your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a <strong>custom magic gun</strong> using <strong>powerful spell combinations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong> ensure no two runs are the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight <strong>ink monsters</strong> and <strong>challenging bosses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock dozens of scrolls and magical items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy-to-learn combat system</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Starrow Castles Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! We're Adrian and Krzysztof, two friends creating this game. We've put a lot of love and determination into making our dream come true with our very first title - <i>Wish Me Well</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please keep in mind that we're very small studio at the beginning of game-creating journey and while we've done our best to give you the best possible experience it may have its flaws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for giving us and our game a try and have fun playing it!</p>","developers":["Starrow Castles"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com